{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/e195f7ca441d1d1925e7838fac503c64.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, no closet is without skeletons. You are James Arnold, a rookie detective assigned to investigate the assassination of New Eastbrook's mayor, Casey Ward, as well as the seemingly-connected deaths of police officers throughout the year of 2022. Every lead drags you deeper into a web of mob power, crooked cops, and corruption that will not yield. Savour a fully-voiced tumultuous detective story involving constant emotional, rarely clear-cut decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/5744a172f8e44a97ce76b341640bcbfa.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search crime scenes for hidden evidence</strong>, from bloody weapons left behind to mobile phones of victims containing suspicious phone records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the evidence obtained to build an idea of what happened in each crime scene, the motives behind the crime, and who committed it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate suspects</strong> using a mix of sympathy, stone-cold neutrality, and raw aggression as needed to draw out the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No choice is ever clean</strong>; the paths you take in each case will reveal what type of detective you choose to be.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/dde57613c51d911f400008ebe2ca4bff.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a <strong>gritty, melee-only combat</strong> using a vast array of weapons, from baseball bats to meat cleavers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone against the worst of the city, from thugs in a back alley to mob enforcers in a warehouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a combination of timing, positioning, and bravery</strong> to defeat enemies in encounters where the odds are never in your favour.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/b9f74078623f7c068b7cc35b5e6f4dd7.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, <strong>visit the various barbers and clothing shops</strong> to change your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy houses across the city and customize their interior furniture to your liking.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your ride</strong>: paint jobs, seat colours, interiors, and tires; as well as a spoiler and a supercharger (which also tunes your car's engine).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in businesses</strong> that return a steady income to keep the lifestyle going.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/b9d24e87098900504c6a19c582fd74dc.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a large open world where you can also visit restaurants to refuel and pawn shops to sell whatever junk you collect along the way of your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in side activities such as backyard brawls.</p></li></ul>","background":"https