bs, seat colours, interiors, and tires; as well as a spoiler and a supercharger (which also tunes your car's engine).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in businesses</strong> that return a steady income to keep the lifestyle going.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/extras/b9d24e87098900504c6a19c582fd74dc.avif?t=1758076094\" width=1517 height=221 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a large open world where you can also visit restaurants to refuel and pawn shops to sell whatever junk you collect along the way of your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in side activities such as backyard brawls.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fahlawa Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986620/dbbfaa6738f35e1dfa9c8d2613e51895e2609172/header.jpg?t=1758076094","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257188924,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188924/movie480.mp4?t=1758074622","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188924/movie_max.mp4?t=1758074622"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188924/00b28c651398f5cdd4ce97988226bf8f74148e51/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758074622","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188924/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758074622","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188924/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758074622"}}],"name":"Unattached: City of Shadows","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>P